    {
      "source": "Resolve a <a href=\"PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a> from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Serializable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>Serializable</code></a> lambda implementing a functional interface accepting a\nsingle method argument and returning a value. The form of the interface must follow a design aligned with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从实现接受单个方法参数并返回值的函数式接口的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Serializable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>Serializable</code></a> lambda 中解析出 <a href=\"PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>。该接口的形式必须遵循与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> 一致的设计。",
      "count": 1
